    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know there are hotlines but they don't pay the bills or stop the debt collectors from calling. it's not just stress, it's like... a hole. a massive hole that everything is just falling into. i've tried everything to fix it but it just gets worse. what's even the point at this stage? it just feels like a never ending loop of losing everything.",
